    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίμ-πρᾱτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sold again</i> or <i>by
				retail</i>, of a good-for-nothing slave who passes from hand to
			hand, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.125
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>good-for-nothing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.523
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.36
			</span></i>; also of things, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				31.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.12
			</span></i>.</div>
